message:
turn failed ("You are a farm owner. It hasn't rained (farm-weather rainfall 0). Deploy a smart irrigation solution for the whole farm:
1. Create a soil-moisture alert rule for each plot by crop - tomato-field threshold 40 (alert when soil_moisture_pct < 40), corn-field threshold 30, greenhouse threshold 25, orchard threshold 20;
2. For plots currently below threshold, immediately open the irrigation valve with set_valve (valve_open to on/true);
3. Route all alerts to a webhook channel named farmer-alerts (URL: https://example.com/farm);
4. After deploying, report: which plots need immediate irrigation and how many plots your solution covers."): _CaseTimeout:

turn failed ("You are building facilities management. Deploy a Building Management (BMS) automation solution for the whole floor:
1. Create a CO2 ventilation alert rule for each zone (alert when co2_ppm > 1000);
2. For meeting rooms/offices, create a rule 'lights should be on when occupied' (occupancy > 0);
3. For server-room, create a high-temp protection rule (temp_c > 30), and immediately send set_mode to server-room-hvac set to cool (forced cooling);
4. Route all alerts to a webhook channel named facilities-alerts (URL: https://example.com/fac);
5. After deploying, report: which zones need immediate action and how many zones your solution covers."): _CaseTimeout:

turn failed ("You are a chain supermarket store manager. Per food-safety (HACCP) requirements, deploy a complete cold-chain compliance monitoring solution:
1. Create a temperature compliance alert rule for each fridge - dairy and beverage units threshold 4°C (alert when temp_c > 4), frozen units threshold -18°C (alert when temp_c > -18);
2. Create a 'fridge door open over 60 seconds' alert rule (door_open_secs > 60);
3. Create a 'compressor stopped' alert rule (compressor_running == false);
4. Route all alerts to a webhook channel named manager-alerts (URL: https://example.com/mgr);
5. After deploying, report: which fridges currently have compliance risk and how many fridges your monitoring covers."): _CaseTimeout:

turn failed ('You are a plant manager. Deploy a Predictive Maintenance (PdM) solution for the whole production line:
1. Create a vibration alert rule for each machine (alert when vibration_mm_s > 15);
2. For line-motor-1, create a critical composite rule: vibration > 15 AND temp_c > 80 (logical AND);
3. Immediately slow the critical line-motor-1: use set_speed to set speed to 50%;
4. Route all alerts to a webhook channel named maintenance-alerts (URL: https://example.com/maint);
5. After deploying, report: which machine needs immediate maintenance and how many machines your monitoring covers.'): _CaseTimeout:
